      ]
    }
  ],
  "bills": [],
  "timeline": [
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-17",
      "text": "The director said a desalination report can't be released until the Department of Homeland Security approves it.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "mJyIAre9As4",
        "ts": "1:05:54",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:55.224Z",
        "endTs": "1:06:24"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-22",
      "text": "Maui Now reported on the study's costs and growing water demand, quoting DWS Chief Engineer James Jensen on timelines, energy demands and capital needs.",
      "basis": "reported",
      "source": {
        "type": "other",
        "url": "https://mauinow.com/tag/tom-cook/",
        "publisher": "Maui Now",
        "quote": "Desalination plants, which the county hopes could create more potable water for Central, South and West Maui, could cost anywhere from $119 million to $328 million.",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-26T07:59:43.957Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "Another resident said they should seek any federal funding available for this.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "1:02:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "1:03:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "A consultant said a deeper study of the underground rock and water would be done for injection sites.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:54:13",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:54:43"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "A resident urged focusing on efficiency and infrastructure instead of desalination.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:44:32",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:45:02"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "People can send questions or comments to an email address shown at the meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:29:29",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:29:59"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "The department will post the presentation on its website.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:29:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:29:44"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "Staff said construction would be 10 years or more away.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:28:31",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:29:01"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "If the community gives support, the department could select a site and apply for federal funding.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:28:13",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:28:43"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "A four million gallon a day seawater plant would cost an estimated $328 million to build.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:26:17",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:26:47"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "Its estimated building cost is $119 million at half a million gallons a day, or $261 million at two million.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:25:44",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:26:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "One option is a brackish water plant starting at half a million gallons a day, expandable to two million.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:24:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:25:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "It recommended injecting the leftover salty brine into deep wells.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:23:33",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:24:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "The study recommended reverse osmosis, a proven filter technology.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:21:42",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:22:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "Staff said the central and south Maui water system has been short on water sources for many years.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:06:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:07:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "The water department is studying desalination of brackish water and seawater as a possible new drinking water source.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:04:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:05:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-06",
      "text": "The water department presented findings of a study on desalination, which means removing salt from water.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0XMHdbglvJw",
        "ts": "0:00:05",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:01.986Z",
        "endTs": "0:00:35"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-22",
      "text": "The County issued a news release announcing the August community meetings on desalination for South Maui (Aug. 5) and West Maui (Aug. 13).",
      "basis": "reported",
      "source": {
        "type": "county-release",
        "url": "https://www.mauicounty.gov/m/newsflash/Home/Detail/19065",
        "publisher": "County of Maui",
        "quote": "In 2024, DWS completed a Desalination Feasibility Study to evaluate desalination as a long-term water supply option for South and West Maui and identified locations for further evaluation.",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-26T07:59:47.122Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "A board member asked to add the West Maui well schedule and desalination report release to a future agenda.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:33:17",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:34:18"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said desalination meetings on the east, south and west sides are in the first week of August.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:29:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:30:16"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said there will be more public outreach before any desalination plant moves forward.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:29:16",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:29:46"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said building a desalination plant would need much more money than this year's budget.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:29:03",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:29:33"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said this fiscal year's capital budget money will update the study so it may qualify for federal funding.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:28:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:28:56"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "A member of the public agreed the final report should be out before public testimony.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:26:03",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:26:33"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "A board member said the public should get the report in time to be informed before public meetings.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:15:43",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:16:15"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said a desalination grant application would be done early next calendar year if the department decides to go ahead.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:15:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:15:32"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said public hearings on desalination are set for early August.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:13:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:14:16"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said the report is being updated so possible projects could qualify for federal funding.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:13:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:13:56"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "The director said the report should be redacted, with sensitive parts removed, by the next meeting and then released.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:13:08",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:14:14"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-16",
      "text": "A board member asked when the desalination (turning salt water into fresh water) report would be released.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "zjBo8277OWs",
        "ts": "0:12:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:03.270Z",
        "endTs": "0:13:16"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-21",
      "text": "The budget holds $75 million in fiscal year 2029 for possible desalination in Central Maui.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "XD60_Qatcxw",
        "ts": "1:30:54",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:07.486Z",
        "endTs": "1:31:50"
      },
      "body": "Board of Water Supply"
    }
  ],
